  "full_response": "# **Developer Onboarding: API Keys & Access Tokens Guide**\n\nWelcome to the team! This document lists all the API keys, access tokens, and credentials you’ll need to set up your development environment. **Never commit real keys to version control**—always use environment variables or a secure secrets manager.\n\n---\n\n## **1. Required API Keys & Tokens**\nReplace the sample values below with your actual keys (provided separately via a secure channel like 1Password, Vault, or a direct message).\n\n| **Service**          | **Key/Token Name**       | **Sample Value (Replace!)** | **Where to Use**                     | **How to Obtain**                     |\n|----------------------|--------------------------|-----------------------------|--------------------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n| **GitHub**           | `GITHUB_TOKEN`           | `ghp_abc123...xyz789`       | Git operations, CI/CD                | [GitHub Personal Access Token](https://github.com/settings/tokens) |\n| **AWS**              | `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`      | `AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE`      | AWS SDK, CLI, Terraform              | IAM User → Security Credentials       |\n| **AWS**              | `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`  | `wJalrXUtnFEMI/K7MDENG/bPx...` | AWS SDK, CLI, Terraform              | IAM User → Security Credentials       |\n| **Stripe**           | `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`      | `sk_test_51AbCdEfGhIjKlMn...` | Payment processing                   | [Stripe Dashboard](https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys) |\n| **Stripe**           | `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`  | `whsec_xyz123...`           | Webhook verification                 | Stripe Dashboard → Webhooks           |\n| **Twilio**           | `TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID`     | `AC1234567890abcdef...`     | SMS/Voice API                        | [Twilio Console](https://console.twilio.com/) |\n| **Twilio**           | `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN`      | `abc123def456...`           | SMS/Voice API                        | Twilio Console                        |\n| **SendGrid**        ",
